{"reviewId": "426066534_8aSsk33cA", "review": {"abstract": "沫，流入实体经济就会造成通货膨胀，由于大量超额流动性进入了股市、房市、期货市场而不是实体经济，从而造就了资产市场的牛市，而没有产生通货膨胀。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "结合现状，虽然这个观点好像解释了流动性进入虚拟经济，但是还是没有闭环，按理如果推高了虚拟资产价格，那么他的消费也会跟着一起提高，然而现实并没有，所以这套理论还是没有解释清楚流动性最终去向", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8687-8757", "createTime": 1785030151, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "426066534_8aSsk33cA", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 274609482, "name": "晴天时有下猪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKia96iaJzQSwFVZHAvxBAN0LwVmDMw3JBYbpBuuH2ppI7IugfFltmehomqibrCsJrZIFgvibP8pocf6w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240101-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCoun